    "updated_at": "2019-10-22T14:46:55Z",
    "body": "I've encountered the same bug while working on #556 it seems that the test will load the user config.\r\n\r\nadding an empty config in the test like this:\r\n```rust\r\n        .use_config(toml::toml! {\r\n            [aws]\r\n        })\r\n```\r\n\r\nfix the issue, but this doesn't feel right.\r\n\r\nI don't know if the issue also occurs with other module, but maybe we should load the default config by default, or maybe have a `use_default_config()` method.",
