    "body": "I had another look at how tests are made. It seems that by default, we set an empty config for each test, but it is passed as an environment variable. The issue was that we remove the environment variable prior to running the test. Which wasn't needed, because it was removed just before assigning the empty config.\r\n\r\nI've pushed a fix to #556 that should resolve this.",
